= Path repairs begin

The main path will be dug up and relaid over the first two weekends
of November. Plots on the lower field should move anything precious
away from the edge before the digger arrives on the Saturday.

= Tea rota

The February tool-sharpening morning needs two volunteers for the
tea urn. Names to the secretary, please, before the end of the
month. Last year's queue for sharpening reached the gate by ten.
